0003-keep-same-section-short-branches

A conditional branch (REL14) to a target in the same object section keeps its original instruction
and gets no relocation: the distance is preserved, while the convention of 0002 cannot express
offsets of 32 KB and more in a 16-bit field (139 fixup overflows on Crackdown 2).

